      "rules": "2014",
      "revision": 1
    },
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>武器（三叉戟），极珍稀（需同调）</em></p><p>你用这把魔法三叉戟发动的攻击检定与其伤害掷骰具有+2加值。此外，若你身处于水下，你用这把武器发动的攻击检定将具有优势。</p><p>这把三叉戟具有3发充能，你可以消耗1发充能用其施展<em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.spell.Item.9zy4xObdmQFW9VP7]{操控水体 Control Water}</em>（豁免DC15）或是消耗3发充能用其施展<em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.spell.Item.fxyDbkauLN9jv6Wx]{海啸术Tsunami}</em>（豁免DC15）。这把三叉戟每日黎明时分恢复[[/r 1d3]]发已消耗的充能数。</p><p>You gain a +2 bonus to attack and damage rolls made with this magic trident. You also have advantage on attack rolls made with this weapon while underwater.</p><p>This trident has 3 charges. You can expend 1 charge to cast @spell[Control Water] (save DC 15) from the trident or 3 charges to cast @spell[Tsunami] (save DC 15) from it instead. The trident regains [[/r 1d3]] expended charges daily at dawn.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
